          "zh": [
            "OpenAI GPT 模型现已在 AWS 上可用。",
            "OpenAI Codex 现已在 AWS 上可用。",
            "OpenAI 托管代理服务现已在 AWS 上可用。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This integration provides AWS enterprise customers with direct access to OpenAI's advanced AI capabilities. It aims to accelerate AI development and deployment within existing cloud infrastructure while enhancing data security for corporate applications.",
          "zh": "此次集成使 AWS 企业客户能够直接访问 OpenAI 的高级 AI 功能。此举旨在加速现有云基础设施内的 AI 开发与部署，同时增强企业应用程序的数据安全性。"
        },
        "source": "OpenAI News",
